          "actions": {
            "value": null
          },
          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your elemental heritage is reflected in the oils and fragrances of plants, in tree resin that fossilizes into amber, or in the gentle smell of a flower. Sticky, golden sap runs through your veins instead of blood. Each time a creature deals slashing or piercing damage to you with a melee Strike, your sap coats its weapon or unarmed attack. The creature takes a –1 circumstance penalty on attack rolls with that weapon or unarmed attack until the end of its turn.</p>"
          },
          "level": {
            "value": 1
          },
          "prerequisites": {
